{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is in danger and cries out for a hero who can save it. But that\u2019s not our problem. Here, we just play tennis. Seriously, you\u2019re insisting on a deep storyline in a tennis game? Well, let\u2019s say your dream is to become the world\u2019s greatest tennis player, and to achieve that, you\u2019ll need to face the most skilled and bizarre opponents. But if you ask me why this includes defeating a giant sea monster, I\u2019ll owe you an explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Quacol\u00e9 Tennis, you\u2019ll discover that there are no limits for those who want to become the best. From the depths of the sea to above the clouds, every place is perfect for tennis matches! Prove your worth on the most unusual courts in friendly matches for up to 4 players or beat all the challenges in the single-player and 2-player cooperative campaigns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEIRD CHARACTERS</strong><br><strong> </strong>Dozens of characters to choose from, each one stranger than the other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/e0cf4f534a39fcee71e4ee0c13f1885f.poster.avif?t=1761251136\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/e0cf4f534a39fcee71e4ee0c13f1885f.webm?t=1761251136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/e0cf4f534a39fcee71e4ee0c13f1885f.mp4?t=1761251136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DANGERS ON THE COURT</strong><br><strong> </strong>Be careful where you step. The path to becoming the best is filled with obstacles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/3b9082d7797187d5094bdbf3ee1f614f.poster.avif?t=1761251136\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/3b9082d7797187d5094bdbf3ee1f614f.webm?t=1761251136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/3b9082d7797187d5094bdbf3ee1f614f.mp4?t=1761251136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPECIAL POWERS</strong><br><strong> </strong>Surprise your opponents with special abilities. Each character has one, so be prepared for all kinds of crazy techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/bcaae1276f425dda059176fc4ad0282d.poster.avif?t=1761251136\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/bcaae1276f425dda059176fc4ad0282d.webm?t=1761251136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/bcaae1276f425dda059176fc4ad0282d.mp4?t=1761251136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GIANT MONSTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the most terrifying beasts with the power of your racket!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/eaf413b5ac016bde5ec4e1d4ae8dc283.poster.avif?t=1761251136\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/eaf413b5ac016bde5ec4e1d4ae8dc283.webm?t=1761251136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Too lazy to read and just looking for a feature list? Here\u2019s everything you\u2019ll find in Quacol\u00e9 Tennis:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 characters with unique attributes and powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different courts, each with its own obstacles and dangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 and 2v2 tennis matches (or 2v1 as well, life\u2019s not fair, so why should this game be?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player and Co-op campaigns for 2 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles (is this still a tennis game?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your racket and call your friends for the greatest adventure in the world of tennis!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3406330?t=1761251136","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761251136","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/f476a7077928dfe7503394bc22e9cafaf1046d91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761251136","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/f476a7077928dfe7503394bc22e9cafaf1046d91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761251136","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"descri